    narr:generatedFrom "37b6bf2c84965cc245e031aab2e50ce7a0484a10" ;
    narr:narration """Xavier's voice here runs from [inviting scrutiny before the steering group pushes](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_10) through two technical positions. The first builds from [a shared-dispatch-desk argument for pairing two sites](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_12), which he then stress-tests himself by [flagging the thinness of its evidence](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21). He grounds [a hard replica-only rule during cutover](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_26) in [a past outage caused by reporting under load](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_24) and prices the tradeoff with [a replica-lag range](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_28). The second thread runs from [an open question on reference-data ownership](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_34) to [a firm vendor-stays-system-of-record position](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_36) argued via [a drift risk between sites](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_38). A week later he [ranks competing arguments for the same rule](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_15), offers [a learning-curve rationale](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_19), and [names a previously unstated assumption both rules rest on](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_25).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_10> ;
